00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:08,560
Let's say this one comes first.

344
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:11,920
Once this is done, I can write it down and reuse it over here.

345
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:18,079
And then in here, we're going to call f of n minus 3.

346
00:16:18,079 --> 00:16:19,520
So there's still a number.

