00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:22,879
So let's see.

365
00:17:22,879 --> 00:17:25,300
Write the code for our recursive function.

366
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:28,639
So in general, once we have a sort bot description,

367
00:17:28,639 --> 00:17:30,120
we can turn this into code.

368
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:32,420
We define f of i.

