00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,240
That's our recursive algorithm.

373
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,840
But we're going to do a little more now.

374
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:48,620
First, we're going to check whether this subproblem that we're trying to solve has already been solved.

