00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:33,340
So we say, is this subproblem, is i, in my memo data structure?

383
00:18:33,340 --> 00:18:35,080
If so, just return memo of i.

384
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:35,620
Done.

385
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:36,980
No recursion necessary.

386
00:18:36,980 --> 00:18:39,399
Otherwise, check if I'm a base case.

