411
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:48,300
That's the whole idea of a memo table.

412
00:19:48,300 --> 00:19:51,540
So we will solve each subproblem at most once.

413
00:19:51,540 --> 00:19:53,659
And so we just need to count how much time

414
00:19:53,659 --> 00:19:56,040
