00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:24,600
So this turns out to be a very nice closed form in this case.

427
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:29,919
It should be exactly n subproblems to compute F of n

428
00:20:29,919 --> 00:20:32,980
because we start at 1.

429
00:20:32,980 --> 00:20:36,040
And each one has one addition involved.

