00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:40,100
I guess not the base case, so maybe n minus 2.

431
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:40,600
OK.

432
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:43,139
Definitely order n.

433
00:20:43,139 --> 00:20:46,320
Now there's this one subtlety, which

434
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:47,860
let's forget about dynamic programming for a moment.

