00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:47,399
are much bigger than 64, or whatever your word size happens

452
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:49,000
w is at least log n.

453
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,400
But n is probably bigger than w.

454
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:52,700
It might be bigger or smaller.

455
00:21:52,700 --> 00:21:53,760
We don't know.

456
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:57,660
And in general, to do an n-bit addition,

457
00:21:57,660 --> 00:22:02,080
these are n-bit additions, is going

458
00:22:02,080 --> 00:22:07,280
to take a ceiling of n over w time.

459
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:11,120
So in the end, we will spend this times n,

