00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:22,160
So a bit of a weird running time, but it's polynomial.

463
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:26,040
Whereas this original recursive algorithm was exponential,

464
00:22:26,040 --> 00:22:28,860
here using this one simple idea of just remembering

