00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:43,260
relation.

472
00:22:43,260 --> 00:22:45,680
But if we already knew the solutions

473
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:49,760
to smaller subproblems, we could compute this bigger problem

474
00:22:49,760 --> 00:22:50,700
very efficiently.

475
00:22:50,700 --> 00:22:56,320
This happened to be constant time or constant additions,

476
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:57,980
n over w time.

477
00:22:57,980 --> 00:22:59,700
But as long as this is polynomial

478
00:22:59,700 --> 00:23:02,460
and this is polynomial, we're happy,

