00:39:17,160 --> 00:39:19,859
Let's put some negative numbers on here.

811
00:39:19,859 --> 00:39:24,259
And the model, so you're at the carnival bowling.

812
00:39:24,259 --> 00:39:27,560
Each pin has potentially different values.

813
00:39:27,560 --> 00:39:33,560
And the model is, if you hit one pin,

814
00:39:33,720 --> 00:39:35,879
you get i.

815
00:39:35,879 --> 00:39:38,879
Then you get vi points.

816
00:39:38,879 --> 00:39:40,879
So that's straightforward.

817
00:39:40,879 --> 00:39:43,720
To make it interesting, when you hit two pins,

818
00:39:43,720 --> 00:39:45,879
