819
00:39:45,879 --> 00:39:48,879
So if I hit two pins, it's always i and i plus 1,

820
00:39:48,879 --> 00:39:50,379
for some i.

821
00:39:50,379 --> 00:39:53,759
You get vi times vi plus 1 points.

822
00:39:53,759 --> 00:39:58,480
This is the game you're playing.

823
00:39:58,480 --> 00:40:00,879
And it doesn't really matter that this is a product.

824
00:40:00,879 --> 00:40:02,959
The product is just some weird function that's

