00:40:15,260 --> 00:40:16,520
or pair it with its right neighbor.

831
00:40:16,520 --> 00:40:17,860
But the pairings can't overlap.

832
00:40:17,860 --> 00:40:19,700
Because once I hit a pin, it's gone.

833
00:40:19,700 --> 00:40:21,260
It's knocked over.

834
00:40:21,260 --> 00:40:22,220
It disappears.

835
00:40:22,220 --> 00:40:25,700
So because of these 9s, which are very high value,

