00:40:30,300 --> 00:40:31,760
Because 9 times 9 is 81.

839
00:40:31,760 --> 00:40:32,760
That's really hard.

840
00:40:32,760 --> 00:40:33,420
Really big.

841
00:40:33,420 --> 00:40:35,960
Much better than hitting them individually or hitting 9 times

842
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:37,920
1 or 9 times 2.

843
00:40:37,920 --> 00:40:40,200
1 and 1 is kind of funny because it's actually

844
00:40:40,200 --> 00:40:41,760
better to hit them individually.

845
00:40:41,760 --> 00:40:42,960
That will give you two points.

846
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:46,280
Whereas if I pair them up, I only get one point.

847
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:47,980
2 and minus 5, that seems bad.

848
00:40:47,980 --> 00:40:49,020
Negative 10 points.

849
00:40:49,020 --> 00:40:51,060
My goal is to maximize score.

850
00:40:57,060 --> 00:41:00,340
Do you have to hit all the pins?

851
00:41:00,340 --> 00:41:02,560
Let's say no, you don't have to hit all the pins.

